WEBVTT

00:14:27.196 --> 00:14:31.196
What have you specifically found
related to happiness and health outcomes?

00:14:32.836 --> 00:14:37.436
RW: What we find is that happiness

00:14:37.436 --> 00:14:41.596
turns out to make us age more slowly

00:14:41.636 --> 00:14:45.356
and keep us able longer.

00:14:45.396 --> 00:14:51.556
So the diseases of aging
that happen to all of us, happen later,

00:14:51.596 --> 00:14:53.676
sometimes they don't happen at all

00:14:53.716 --> 00:14:58.236
in people who are happier
have a greater sense of well-being.

00:14:58.276 --> 00:15:02.276
And it's because of what I spoke about
a few minutes ago,